        "subject": "feat(console): business summary and tabs, proof review beside the decision, proofs viewed in place; 0137 store wording; \"boutique\" in French",
        "body": "feat(console): business summary and tabs, proof review beside the decision, proofs viewed in place; 0137 store wording; \"boutique\" in French\n\nOwner, 2026-11-12 (layout review, approved direction; not yet published):\n- One business: a summary (state, Store ID, paid until, stores, monthly total, the\n  one next action) and five tabs - Stores, Payments, People, Messages & history,\n  Settings. Access decisions with the payments; status decisions in Settings;\n  deleting the business in its own danger zone.\n- Payment review: one proof per full-width card, the proof beside the decision\n  (on top of it on a phone), the latest revision named first, Approve primary,\n  Refuse secondary; the stale-revision refusal kept.\n- Payments tab: every proof of the business - approved and refused included -\n  viewed in place on request, read-only, Download apart (GET\n  platform/payment-proofs?company=).\n- 0137 wording: an additional store opens when its own payment is confirmed,\n  with its own paid month and no trial; a seat paid during the trial still starts\n  at its end.\n- French: \"boutique\" for a customer's store in the portal, console and public\n  site, with articles and agreements; legal pages left for their own review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
